<title>SWITZERLAND: Elektrowatt 1995/96 net falls on provisions.</title>
<headline>Elektrowatt 1995/96 net falls on provisions.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss utility Elektrowatt AG said group net profit for the 1995/96 fiscal year, which ends today, would fall to around 90 million Swiss francs from 210 million francs in 1994/95 due to various provisions.</p>
<p>Elektrowatt also said in a statement that 1995/96 operating profit should come to some 210 million francs or around the previous year's level of 210 million.</p>
</text>
